---
import LegalDocument from '../../../components/LegalDocument.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const contactEmail = 'support@londonberry.com';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Starsift: Sand Sort Puzzle"
  description="Starsift is a calm sand sorting puzzle for iPhone with a story told in pictures. Help, contact and privacy."
>
  <LegalDocument
    overline="An iPhone game by Londonberry"
    title="Starsift: Sand Sort Puzzle"
    description="Every star fell and lies in the desert as colored sand. Sift it back, jar by jar, across thirty painted nights."
    effectiveDate="November 11, 2026"
  >
    <h2>Support</h2>
    <p>
      Stuck on a night, found a bug, or have a question about a purchase? Email <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a> and we will get back to you, usually within a day.
    </p>

    <h2>How to play</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Tap a jar to send it onto the belt under the picture.</li>
      <li>A jar takes only its own color, and only from the bottom of the frame.</li>
      <li>Fill a jar and it lights a star. Light them all to return the constellation.</li>
      <li>The belt has only so many places. If every place is full and nothing can move, the night jams and one ember goes out.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>The lantern</h2>
    <p>
      The lantern holds five embers. One comes back every 15 minutes on its own. If you would rather not wait, you can relight the whole lantern at once for $1.99. That is the only thing for sale, and there are no ads.
    </p>
    <p>
      If a purchase did not relight your lantern, close and reopen the game. For refunds, Apple handles every App Store purchase at <a href="https://reportaproblem.apple.com">reportaproblem.apple.com</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      The game collects nothing. Read the <a href="/apps/starsift/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a>.
    </p>
  </LegalDocument>
</BaseLayout>
